// IntroString :
"P1238875411" "So Dr. Vahzilok plans to come to Rogue Islands, eh? This bad for Krylov's business, but Krylov have plan. Great BIG plan...<br><br>Dr. Vahzilok is big tough villain in Paragon City that everyone knows, nyet? Well, if Dr. Vahzilok is too busy fighting heroes, he can't make visit to Rogue Islands! I say we set up Dr. Vahzilok for fall!<br><br>I know some Vahzilok surgeons in Paragon City who I worked with on some 'special experiments'. I will tell them you are coming to help them gather more 'raw materials'! When the Paragon City heroes find out about kidnappings, they'll be after Dr. Vahzilok like fleas on a dog. Ha ha! <A HREF={ACCEPT}>Now go to Paragon City, kidnap some victims, and take them to the Vahzilok!</a>"
// AcceptString :
"P3076991293" "Bring citizens to Vahzilok surgeons"
// SendOffString :
"P2564821956" "Watch out for Longbow, {VillainName}. They have been very suspicious of who I have been talking to."
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P3614101879" "What are you waiting for? Set up Dr. Vahzilok for fall!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P1913789330" "You dodge various Longbow patrols set up to prevent you from making it into Paragon City. Now kidnap some citizens and take them to the Vahzilok!"

