"P275371695" "{VillainName}! Looks like we put crimp in Dr. Vahzilok's visit to Rogue Islands! Ha ha! His henchman, Facemaker, was planning to meet with him at local office to share notes. Meeting not happening now, but notes could still be very valuable to right bidder! Ha ha! Krylov LOVES capitalist society!<br><br><A HREF={ACCEPT}>Head over to the office and steal the notes from Facemaker</A>.<br><br>The Facemaker, she is one mean lady.  <color orange>You might want to bring some muscle with you</color>."
